WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:47.152
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:47.422 --> 00:49.215
But this isn't an isolated incident.

3
00:49.299 --> 00:51.301
Especially now that there's someone lurking around,

4
00:51.384 --> 00:53.762
that vigilante you call a manananggal.

5
00:53.845 --> 00:55.096
As much as possible,

6
00:55.180 --> 00:57.557
don't tell anyone about this. Not a soul.

7
00:57.640 --> 00:58.892
Especially Chiara and Mikoy.

8
00:58.975 --> 01:00.143
They already have enough on their plate.

9
01:00.226 --> 01:01.895
We don't need to add to it.

10
01:04.981 --> 01:07.358
Now that you've finally said how you really feel,

11
01:07.442 --> 01:08.568
not because you'll end up together,

12
01:08.651 --> 01:09.861
you've won because

13
01:09.944 --> 01:12.655
you're no longer lying about how you really feel.

14
01:14.032 --> 01:15.784
So now, enjoy your life.

15
01:19.370 --> 01:22.373
Did you hear about what happened to ma'am's husband?

16
01:22.457 --> 01:23.374
Viktor Valtrovi?

17
01:23.458 --> 01:25.126
Yes. Apparently, he got badly beaten up.

18
01:25.210 --> 01:27.921
I think we made the wrong call letting him stay here.

19
01:28.004 --> 01:29.339
HQ is going to come after us for this.

20
01:29.422 --> 01:31.132
General Norberto might find out.

21
01:31.216 --> 01:32.467
Let's go.

22
01:33.510 --> 01:35.345
I have an idea, kids.

23
01:35.428 --> 01:38.598
Your Godmother Mylene won't be able to make it to your wedding

24
01:42.227 --> 01:42.936
Because

25
01:43.019 --> 01:47.106
Vicky has agreed to be your wedding godmother.

26
01:47.190 --> 01:48.983
-Really? -Yes!

27
01:49.526 --> 01:50.735
Thank you so much!

28
01:51.861 --> 01:52.654
Mama Vicky.

29
01:52.737 --> 01:53.780
There's an update.

30
01:55.907 --> 01:58.493
Viktor and Donabel won't be able to attend the wedding.

31
02:32.235 --> 02:33.319
Not bad.

32
02:35.864 --> 02:36.698
Thank you.

33
02:43.454 --> 02:44.372
Carlota?

34
02:49.294 --> 02:50.420
What are you doing here?

35
02:51.713 --> 02:54.048
Did Senator Quintin send you?

36
02:54.632 --> 02:56.259
If he sent me,

37
02:56.968 --> 02:58.928
I wouldn't be handing you a tissue.

38
03:00.346 --> 03:01.180
Donabel.

39
03:07.145 --> 03:08.146
Let's go.

40
03:26.789 --> 03:27.665
Where are you?

41
03:28.416 --> 03:29.626
I'm almost there.

42
03:29.709 --> 03:31.878
Are you sure we're safe?

43
03:32.378 --> 03:33.421
You weren't followed?

44
03:33.963 --> 03:36.132
That relationship of yours could complicate things.

45
03:36.216 --> 03:37.800
She's Viktor's former ally.

46
03:37.884 --> 03:39.636
And now she's an agent.

47
03:39.719 --> 03:40.595
That's risky.

48
03:45.975 --> 03:47.060
I'm on my way.

49
03:57.237 --> 03:59.197
Viktor! Viktor!

50
04:13.294 --> 04:15.588
we still have a long way to go.

51
04:17.048 --> 04:18.383
Buckle up first.

52
04:19.092 --> 04:21.261
Wait, where are we going?

53
04:21.844 --> 04:22.845
Albay.

54
04:26.099 --> 04:27.016
Wow!

55
04:27.976 --> 04:29.018
Viktor!

56
04:40.363 --> 04:41.489
I don't know.

57
04:42.282 --> 04:43.199
Maybe

58
04:43.950 --> 04:45.410
I'm getting old too.

59
04:46.202 --> 04:47.412
Or

60
04:48.204 --> 04:50.915
maybe I'm getting tired of counting my enemies.

61
04:54.168 --> 04:56.212
Besides, I'm not the only one.

62
05:04.220 --> 05:05.054
Cocoy.

63
05:05.638 --> 05:08.182
So, we're not okay yet, all right?

64
05:08.266 --> 05:11.269
But whenever I get the chance to help,

65
05:11.352 --> 05:13.146
I'd rather choose to do it.

66
05:16.691 --> 05:18.443
I won't forget this.

67
05:21.779 --> 05:23.239
Because gas is expensive.

68
05:35.835 --> 05:38.212
Wait. Are you two a thing?

69
05:38.296 --> 05:39.338
Huh?

70
05:40.256 --> 05:41.340
No!

71
05:42.008 --> 05:43.092
Ouch.

72
05:47.096 --> 05:48.097
I'm already dating someone.

73
05:48.181 --> 05:49.223
Really?

74
05:50.892 --> 05:52.018
Sianong!

75
06:53.663 --> 06:54.872
Looking good!

76
06:54.956 --> 06:57.041
Looks like you're really all set!

77
06:57.708 --> 06:58.709
Of course.

78
06:58.793 --> 07:01.504
I'm not that skinny, crybaby kid you once knew anymore.

79
07:03.756 --> 07:04.882
Oh, and also,

80
07:04.966 --> 07:08.010
before I head to Manila,

81
07:08.094 --> 07:09.428
can I meet Mama V?

82
07:09.512 --> 07:10.721
Come on.

83
07:10.805 --> 07:11.639
It's not allowed.

84
07:16.102 --> 07:17.645
What a shame!

85
07:18.438 --> 07:20.565
You know, it's been so long

86
07:21.858 --> 07:23.568
since the last time we saw each other.

87
07:24.152 --> 07:25.445
Are you even listening?

88
07:25.528 --> 07:26.737
I said you can't.

89
07:27.321 --> 07:28.531
Besides, it'll be difficult.

90
07:28.614 --> 07:29.657
Everything's already planned out.

91
07:29.740 --> 07:31.868
Even a small change could affect everything.

92
07:32.452 --> 07:35.204
I'm just really excited to see her.

93
07:44.213 --> 07:46.090
The moment we've been waiting for is near.

94
07:46.174 --> 07:47.884
The fulfillment of everything,

95
07:47.967 --> 07:50.386
everything that was destined for us.

96
07:50.470 --> 07:51.512
Do you know that?

97
07:52.472 --> 07:54.515
We were denied justice.

98
07:57.810 --> 07:58.811
Why aren't you excited?

99
07:59.979 --> 08:01.189
Are you having second thoughts?

100
08:05.693 --> 08:07.278
What kind of question is that?

101
08:10.031 --> 08:11.073
You're avoiding the question.

102
08:14.452 --> 08:15.453
You are.

103
08:16.120 --> 08:17.663
Be honest with me.

104
08:18.247 --> 08:19.415
You're having second thoughts, aren't you?

105
08:20.124 --> 08:23.711
You want to walk away from everything we've been planning?

106
08:25.421 --> 08:26.297
Answer me!

107
08:26.380 --> 08:28.007
What are you talking about?

108
08:28.508 --> 08:29.634
You're mistaken.

109
08:30.927 --> 08:32.094
I hope so.

110
08:32.595 --> 08:34.305
I hope I'm wrong.

111
08:34.889 --> 08:37.767
Because I know those eyes all too well.

112
08:38.434 --> 08:40.478
Filled with doubt.

113
08:41.062 --> 08:43.189
I know those movements all too well.

114
08:44.607 --> 08:48.277
So hesitant, filled with doubt.

115
08:48.361 --> 08:50.655
I know them all too well because I used to be the same!

116
08:53.449 --> 08:55.117
I used to be like that too, weak.

117
08:57.203 --> 08:58.412
Letting my emotions take over.

118
09:03.376 --> 09:05.503
Here, ma'am, sir. Have a seat.

119
09:07.922 --> 09:09.507
Hey, it's the Eiffel Tower!

120
09:11.133 --> 09:11.968
Beautiful!

121
09:12.051 --> 09:13.928
The view is beautiful, honey.

122
09:27.483 --> 09:28.651
The view is amazing, isn't it?

123
09:31.779 --> 09:32.989
But of course,

124
09:33.072 --> 09:35.866
in my eyes, you're the most beautiful!

125
09:36.951 --> 09:38.494
You're something else, Sean.

126
09:38.578 --> 09:41.205
I'm really your number one fan!

127
09:41.289 --> 09:42.331
Of course.

128
09:43.291 --> 09:46.669
Of course, it wasn't just your beauty that made me fall in love with you.

129
09:47.336 --> 09:51.549
I fell even more in love with the beauty and goodness of your heart, honey.

130
09:52.133 --> 09:53.009
So, honey,

131
09:54.760 --> 09:58.973
I want you to enjoy all of this, every moment of this trip.

132
09:59.056 --> 10:00.933
Because all of this is for you.

133
10:01.726 --> 10:03.644
For us, honey.

134
10:03.728 --> 10:06.981
And I know you're not a fan of long flights,

135
10:07.064 --> 10:10.943
and I know getting your visa wasn't easy either.

136
10:11.027 --> 10:11.902
It wasn't.

137
10:16.157 --> 10:17.491
Thank you, honey.

138
10:29.670 --> 10:31.422
That's what love can do, huh?

139
10:32.465 --> 10:33.674
It makes you believe.

140
10:34.508 --> 10:37.178
It makes you believe in the beauty of the world.

141
10:37.261 --> 10:40.514
Makes you believe even when you haven't seen tomorrow yet.

142
10:53.152 --> 10:54.153
Honey.

143
10:54.236 --> 10:58.240
Maybe we can just take them somewhere safe?

144
10:58.324 --> 10:59.450
If that's okay with you.

145
11:01.285 --> 11:02.953
Sure, honey. It's up to you.

146
11:28.896 --> 11:29.939
I was just like that!

147
11:31.482 --> 11:33.859
Love made me believe in it too!

148
11:34.610 --> 11:36.153
What a load of crap!

149
11:41.575 --> 11:43.035
There's Alice.

150
11:44.745 --> 11:47.123
She was taken by a syndicate.

151
11:50.209 --> 11:52.461
I used to hold on to hope, thinking

152
11:52.545 --> 11:55.047
there was something I could do, that maybe I could still save her,

153
11:55.131 --> 11:56.132
that maybe

154
11:56.215 --> 11:58.717
we could still be together, that maybe

155
11:59.301 --> 12:01.262
I would still see her, but I didn't.

156
12:02.346 --> 12:04.390
Because the world was never fair.

157
12:05.391 --> 12:08.018
The world was already unfair before you were born.

158
12:08.102 --> 12:11.105
Before any of this even came to be, the world was already unfair!

159
12:11.897 --> 12:13.357
Do you understand?

160
12:17.653 --> 12:18.821
I understand.

161
12:22.450 --> 12:23.659
So you.

162
12:24.326 --> 12:26.162
Don't you go getting weak on me.

163
12:27.580 --> 12:29.373
Forget all those emotions.

164
12:29.457 --> 12:30.583
It's all nonsense!

165
12:35.045 --> 12:39.884
Whatever bond you have with everyone here,

166
12:39.967 --> 12:41.719
whatever kindness they've shown you,

167
12:41.802 --> 12:44.722
whatever kindness Mikoy and Chiara have shown you,

168
12:44.805 --> 12:46.098
forget all of it.

169
12:48.058 --> 12:49.059
I don't even know.

170
12:49.894 --> 12:53.314
They're crazy in love, thinking

171
12:53.397 --> 12:57.359
their illusion of love can change the world, but it can't!

172
12:59.278 --> 13:00.112
What a load of crap.

173
13:00.196 --> 13:02.948
It's all a load of crap. Do you understand, Rahmboy?

174
13:06.744 --> 13:07.953
So remember,

175
13:09.663 --> 13:11.582
what matters most of all

176
13:11.665 --> 13:14.835
is the plan we're all working on.

177
13:15.836 --> 13:17.505
Forget those emotions.

178
13:18.255 --> 13:19.590
They don't matter!

179
14:13.477 --> 14:14.436
Oh?

180
14:17.314 --> 14:19.608
Carlota has a surprise.

181
14:19.692 --> 14:21.735
Looks like she's coming back here to Albay.

182
14:30.160 --> 14:34.373
because it's Chiara and Mikoy's wedding!

183
14:34.456 --> 14:36.500
-There you go, guys. Say hi! -Hi!

184
14:37.668 --> 14:39.128
Are you excited?

185
14:39.211 --> 14:40.170
-Of course. -Chiara!

186
14:40.254 --> 14:43.841
Oh, my daughter looks beautiful!

187
14:43.924 --> 14:44.925
The bride!

188
14:45.009 --> 14:46.844
I don't want to be…

189
14:46.927 --> 14:48.929
Wait, we need to take a selfie.

190
14:49.013 --> 14:50.472
-A groupie. -Groupie, come on.

191
14:55.311 --> 14:56.729
Oh!

192
14:56.812 --> 14:59.356
Miss Minda should watch out.

193
14:59.440 --> 15:01.400
I'm going to tease her about how beautiful we look today.

194
15:01.483 --> 15:03.611
See? I'll send this to her.

195
15:03.694 --> 15:05.654
Is this good?

196
15:08.073 --> 15:09.825
-One more? -Sure.

197
15:16.373 --> 15:19.251
Today is Mikoy and Chiara's wedding.

198
15:19.335 --> 15:23.047
And of course, I'm here with the groom's team!

199
15:24.548 --> 15:25.382
Sir Mario, Angelito!

200
15:25.466 --> 15:28.218
-Wave, guys! One more, say hi! -Hello!

201
15:28.302 --> 15:29.428
-Hello! -Okay, picture, picture.

202
15:29.511 --> 15:31.639
There you go, looking sharp!

203
15:33.057 --> 15:34.600
Wave, kolokoys!

204
15:37.394 --> 15:39.521
Tess sent a groupie.

205
15:40.940 --> 15:42.566
-Team bride. -Whoa, whoa, whoa.

206
15:42.650 --> 15:44.652
We can't let them beat us. We need a team groom photo.

207
15:47.988 --> 15:49.239
-Get in position, get in position. -Where's Mikoy?

208
15:49.323 --> 15:51.033
Mikoy?

209
15:51.116 --> 15:52.534
-Bro Mikoy. -Mikoy!

210
16:13.013 --> 16:14.640
Looking handsome!

211
16:14.723 --> 16:15.724
That's my bro!

212
16:24.817 --> 16:25.859
You're shaking.

213
16:26.360 --> 16:27.444
Are you nervous?

214
16:28.320 --> 16:29.822
A little, Dad.

215
16:30.864 --> 16:32.241
You can do this.

216
16:32.324 --> 16:33.701
Just be brave.

217
16:40.374 --> 16:41.709
Love you too, son.

218
16:43.877 --> 16:45.963
Okay, selfie time. Let's take a selfie.

219
16:46.046 --> 16:47.506
Groupie, groupie!

220
16:47.589 --> 16:49.550
-Groupie! -Come here.

221
16:49.633 --> 16:52.052
Come on.

222
16:54.263 --> 16:55.389
Wait, wait, wait.

223
16:55.472 --> 16:57.057
-Rahmboy. -Rahmboy.

224
16:58.600 --> 16:59.435
That's right.

225
16:59.518 --> 17:00.602
-That's right! -Come, quick!

226
17:00.686 --> 17:01.687
You're family.

227
17:01.770 --> 17:03.355
You're like one of the others.

228
17:03.439 --> 17:05.858
Don't be an outsider. Come on!

229
17:05.941 --> 17:07.985
There!

230
17:13.323 --> 17:15.617
Oh, your favorite!

231
17:23.167 --> 17:24.460
Oh, wow!

232
17:24.543 --> 17:25.711
Chilimansi.

233
17:26.962 --> 17:29.048
-Let's eat. -Come on, let's eat.

234
17:30.132 --> 17:31.175
Hey.

235
17:43.145 --> 17:46.690
Posing for a photoshoot is pretty tiring, huh?

236
17:47.191 --> 17:48.692
I'm tired too!

237
17:48.776 --> 17:49.777
Tell me about it.

238
17:49.860 --> 17:52.404
My face was so tired from smiling the whole time.

239
17:52.488 --> 17:55.032
My facial muscles are exhausted.

240
17:56.575 --> 17:58.494
Good thing we can go for round three.

241
17:58.577 --> 18:00.287
I didn't even make it to round four.

242
18:00.370 --> 18:02.873
I plan to take home bacon. So good!

243
18:06.335 --> 18:08.504
I even had an egg cooked for me.

244
18:08.587 --> 18:11.006
I told them to leave the yolk runny,

245
18:11.090 --> 18:14.009
but they still burned it. I ate it anyway.

246
18:14.093 --> 18:15.135
Still tasted good!

247
18:15.219 --> 18:16.345
-Even if it's burnt. -Yes.

248
18:16.428 --> 18:17.846
You guys can't beat me.

249
18:17.930 --> 18:18.931
Why?

250
18:22.267 --> 18:24.478
You got takeout adobo?

251
18:24.978 --> 18:26.647
You're really something else.

252
18:26.730 --> 18:28.482
How you did that?

253
18:29.483 --> 18:30.609
Can’t be hungry.

254
18:31.735 --> 18:33.153
Sofie.

255
18:33.237 --> 18:34.488
Yes, that’s Sofie.

256
18:36.782 --> 18:38.450
-It's Angelito. -So…

257
18:38.534 --> 18:39.576
Angelito.

258
18:40.577 --> 18:42.162
Oh, right,

259
18:42.246 --> 18:44.039
my brother needs something.

260
18:44.123 --> 18:46.208
I'll get back to you, okay? I'll get back to you.

261
18:47.668 --> 18:48.794
They're getting married?

262
18:48.877 --> 18:50.003
Why did he leave?

263
18:50.796 --> 18:51.964
It's like they're avoiding each other.

264
18:52.548 --> 18:53.757
Why are they avoiding each other?

265
18:53.841 --> 18:56.176
Didn't they just have a pretend wedding?

266
18:56.260 --> 18:57.886
A fake wedding that wasn't even real.

267
18:57.970 --> 19:00.097
From a pretend wedding to not talking to each other?

268
19:01.014 --> 19:03.350
Just leave them be. That's how Gen Z is.

269
19:03.433 --> 19:05.144
You know, when you're young

270
19:05.227 --> 19:08.355
and you have a crush on your friend,

271
19:08.438 --> 19:11.275
you can't focus, and of course, you're still shy.

272
19:11.859 --> 19:12.818
Right?

273
19:13.318 --> 19:14.528
All right.

274
19:25.747 --> 19:27.791
All we're missing is popcorn and beer.

275
19:27.875 --> 19:28.876
But those are on the way too.

276
19:28.959 --> 19:32.296
All we're missing are Agents Sianong, Carlota, and Cocoy.

277
19:32.379 --> 19:33.922
Where are those guys?

278
19:34.006 --> 19:35.174
Good question.

279
19:43.140 --> 19:44.141
Did you ask permission?

280
19:44.224 --> 19:46.935
No. As far as I know, he doesn't come in on Saturdays.

281
20:01.575 --> 20:02.492
Brother Mikoy.

282
20:03.911 --> 20:04.786
Hey.

283
20:07.664 --> 20:10.459
You know, I'm going to miss you.

284
20:12.169 --> 20:13.003
A lot.

285
20:16.215 --> 20:17.883
You're still my little boy.

286
20:18.550 --> 20:19.843
Look at me.

287
20:19.927 --> 20:22.429
Come on, I'm not going anywhere.

288
20:22.512 --> 20:25.599
Your brother's just getting married, okay?

289
20:26.934 --> 20:27.935
Wait.

290
20:29.353 --> 20:31.897
I know you won't forget about us.

291
20:33.982 --> 20:34.900
But I also know

292
20:37.027 --> 20:38.779
everything is going to change.

293
20:38.862 --> 20:39.947
Especially at home.

294
20:41.281 --> 20:43.951
Of course, it won't be the same as before.

295
20:48.580 --> 20:49.748
But, Bro,

296
20:49.831 --> 20:50.749
you know…

297
20:54.836 --> 20:56.588
I'm so happy for you.

298
20:58.298 --> 20:59.424
Just think about it.

299
21:00.008 --> 21:01.218
Before,

300
21:03.011 --> 21:07.266
I used to wish that you would find a love

301
21:07.849 --> 21:09.643
like Mom and Dad's.

302
21:12.688 --> 21:13.939
You're right.

303
21:14.022 --> 21:15.232
That's amazing!

304
21:15.315 --> 21:17.985
You really manifested it, kid.

305
21:19.486 --> 21:20.821
I guess I did.

306
21:21.321 --> 21:22.572
So,

307
21:22.656 --> 21:24.616
I'm really, really happy for you.

308
21:25.742 --> 21:26.702
Because

309
21:27.995 --> 21:30.497
someone like you, who's so loving

310
21:31.081 --> 21:32.499
and such a good person,

311
21:32.582 --> 21:34.376
you truly deserve

312
21:40.007 --> 21:41.675
Thank you, Angelito.

313
21:48.598 --> 21:51.059
Sorry, sir. We didn't get to ask for your permission.

314
21:51.143 --> 21:53.353
We promise we'll clean everything up.

315
22:01.570 --> 22:02.529
Ray!

316
22:03.572 --> 22:04.906
Better yet,

317
22:05.407 --> 22:07.451
help me serve the food I brought

318
22:07.534 --> 22:10.746
so our watch party will be more fun, right?

319
22:10.829 --> 22:11.913
Come on!

320
22:23.467 --> 22:25.177
A lot will change.

321
22:25.886 --> 22:27.596
That's just part of life.

322
22:28.722 --> 22:29.681
And you,

323
22:29.765 --> 22:32.476
once you finish college,

324
22:32.559 --> 22:34.269
your world will open up even more!

325
22:34.352 --> 22:36.980
You'll have so many more opportunities.

326
22:37.064 --> 22:39.441
And you'll be able to explore, okay?

327
22:39.524 --> 22:41.485
Just promise me one thing.

328
22:41.568 --> 22:43.653
Whatever decision you make,

329
22:44.154 --> 22:45.989
whatever you do in life,

330
22:46.490 --> 22:50.160
just don't ever, ever, ever give Mom and Dad a reason to worry.

331
22:53.205 --> 22:54.414
And one more thing.

332
22:54.498 --> 22:56.958
Whatever decision you make in life,

333
22:57.542 --> 22:59.044
no matter how difficult it may be,

334
22:59.544 --> 23:01.296
your decisions

335
23:01.379 --> 23:03.298
should always come from a place of love.

336
23:05.634 --> 23:06.468
Yes, bro.

337
23:10.555 --> 23:13.100
I've been proud of you for a long time, Angelito.

338
23:13.934 --> 23:16.603
And I'm proud to have you as my brother.

339
23:27.280 --> 23:28.365
Wait, you know what?

340
23:28.448 --> 23:30.951
I just remembered. I have a gift for Chiara.

341
23:31.034 --> 23:31.952
Wait here, okay?

342
23:36.623 --> 23:38.291
-Bro. -I'll leave this to you, okay?

343
23:38.375 --> 23:40.585
-I'll take care of it. -Thanks.

344
24:12.075 --> 24:17.247
I went over your profiling report on the immediate community in Albay.

345
24:18.540 --> 24:20.834
It seems a little too ordinary.

346
24:20.917 --> 24:24.921
Sometimes something ordinary can also mean

347
24:25.005 --> 24:27.132
there's something too good to be true.

348
24:27.215 --> 24:28.842
Someone stood out to me.

349
24:28.925 --> 24:29.801
Who?

350
24:29.885 --> 24:31.261
That Rahmboy.

351
24:38.935 --> 24:40.103
Sofie!

352
24:40.187 --> 24:41.605
The guy collapsed!

353
24:42.355 --> 24:43.607
Oh my! That guy!

354
24:45.442 --> 24:47.694
-Senator, there's bad news. -What is it?

355
24:47.777 --> 24:49.863
Viktor escaped, along with Donabel.

356
24:49.946 --> 24:51.740
How did that happen? When?

357
24:51.823 --> 24:52.824
It was sudden.

358
24:53.325 --> 24:55.452
Looks like someone up top gave the go-ahead.

359
24:55.535 --> 24:58.246
And who are these annoying people?

360
25:01.166 --> 25:03.251
Wait, guys, we have an update.

361
25:03.335 --> 25:05.253
Someone I know said

362
25:05.337 --> 25:08.006
someone broke Viktor out last night. There.

363
25:10.217 --> 25:11.676
Looks like she escaped too.

364
25:12.177 --> 25:13.929
What? What's happening?

365
25:14.429 --> 25:15.430
And who would break them out?

366
25:15.513 --> 25:17.557
Unless the Valtrovis are here.
